Bundle-Name: Fennec OData Operation API
Bundle-Description: SPI for invoking OData functions and actions: a dynamic EMF model only declares operation signatures (EOperation), so an ODataOperationHandler service provides the behaviour — the runtime resolves the addressed operation, finds the handler and serialises the result (ADR-0007 style pluggability)

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.service.condition;version=latest
